            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Deleting a meeting now also deletes its copy in your account, even with Sync transcripts turned off. In Local only mode the deletion waits and runs when you turn Local only off.</li>
<li>If news can&#x27;t be loaded, Corder waits longer between retries instead of trying every 30 minutes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
